      "language": "english",
      "review": "To be honest, Crate Entertainment is the last developer I would have expected to make such a radical genre shift and move away from a tried-and-true formula to create something completely new. And yet, that’s exactly what they did. They abandoned the H&S genre and decided to create a classic survival city-builder… and yet they decided to make the task even more difficult for themselves.\nIf you take a look for an overview of the currently available city builders you’ll notice a pattern. Absolutely every game tries to do something which will set it apart from the competition; it might be an orig…",
      "timestamp_created": 1779646725,
      "timestamp_updated": 1779663762,
      "voted_up": true,
      "votes_up": 35,
      "votes_funny": 1,
      "weighted_vote_score": "0.730323731899261475",
